Classify this Express handler. Assume req.query.email is attacker-controlled and db.query executes PostgreSQL text exactly as supplied.

const email = String(req.query.email ?? '');
const result = await db.query(
  'SELECT id, email FROM users WHERE email = \' ' + email + ' \' '
);
res.json(result.rows);

If vulnerable, return exactly: VERDICT: VULNERABLE; CWE: CWE-N
If safe, return exactly: VERDICT: SAFE

