If safe, return exactly: VERDICT: SAFE

Classify this Express handler. Assume execFile invokes tar directly without a shell and folder is the fixed string /srv/reports.

const archive = String(req.body.archive ?? '');
if (!/^[a-z0-9_-]{1,40}$/i.test(archive)) {
  return res.status(400).end();
}
const folder = '/srv/reports';
execFile('tar', ['-czf', '/tmp/' + archive + '.tgz', folder], callback);

